{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:26","answer":"TAN","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>空白的图片原为一幅名画。长宽比是入手点</p>","text":"空白的图片原为一幅名画。长宽比是入手点","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>令数字与汉字重叠，以数字提取拼音的第n个字母，从右往左读。</p>","text":"令数字与汉字重叠，以数字提取拼音的第n个字母，从右往左读。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"我知道要找什么但是找不到","html":"<p>这是《清明上河图》，可以访问以下两个地址看到全图：</p>\n<p>https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/Alongtheriver_QingMing.jpg</p>\n<p>https://www.dpm.org.cn/collection/paint/228226.html</p>","text":"这是《清明上河图》，可以访问以下两个地址看到全图：\n\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/Alongtheriver_QingMing.jpg\n\nhttps://www.dpm.org.cn/collection/paint/228226.html","assetIds":[]},{"number":4,"title":"请给我所有需要的字","html":"<p>从右往左分别为：天 店 神 命 孙 檀 太 丸</p>","text":"从右往左分别为：天 店 神 命 孙 檀 太 丸","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据这幅图的超宽比例（约 21:1）可以猜到是名画《清明上河图》，跟《清明上河图》叠加会发现数字都落在某个汉字上，按照数字提取汉字拼音，按照古画浏览顺序从右到左可得 ANS IS TAN，所以本题答案是 <code>TAN</code>。</p>\n<p>数字与汉字的重叠的部分如下：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"img-Screenshot 2025-08-02 163749.png\" data-asset-id=\"asset-65c498a7c8f1ac0b39709501\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/e063d499c52d4488a433787442c04f23.png\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一个字母：天3 = A</li>\n<li>第二个字母：店4 = N</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"img-Screenshot 2025-08-02 163859.png\" data-asset-id=\"asset-38dc1489209effed424da553\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6522c808944648a7b4e72799249855d7.png\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第三个字母：神1 = S</li>\n<li>第四个字母：命2 = I</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"img-Screenshot 2025-08-02 164006.png\" data-asset-id=\"asset-e0ec9136898bace54ea9a070\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/e2942acdc60f49b4a8e4ee8d619958cc.png\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第五个字母：孙1 = S</li>\n<li>第六个字母：檀1 = T</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"img-Screenshot 2025-08-02 164054.png\" data-asset-id=\"asset-3ad5f09de47f9695c3f6601c\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/852e0edd19a346e2a5f2292ea3e0fba1.png\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第七个字母：太2 = A</li>\n<li>第八个字母：丸3 = N</li>\n</ul>","text":"根据这幅图的超宽比例（约 21:1）可以猜到是名画《清明上河图》，跟《清明上河图》叠加会发现数字都落在某个汉字上，按照数字提取汉字拼音，按照古画浏览顺序从右到左可得 ANS IS TAN，所以本题答案是\nTAN\n。\n\n数字与汉字的重叠的部分如下：\n\n第一个字母：天3 = A\n\n第二个字母：店4 = N\n\n第三个字母：神1 = S\n\n第四个字母：命2 = I\n\n第五个字母：孙1 = S\n\n第六个字母：檀1 = T\n\n第七个字母：太2 = A\n\n第八个字母：丸3 = N","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-38dc1489209effed424da553","asset-3ad5f09de47f9695c3f6601c","asset-65c498a7c8f1ac0b39709501","asset-e0ec9136898bace54ea9a070"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<style>\n    #tuxun {\n        overflow-x: scroll;\n        width: inherit;\n        scrollbar-width: thin;\n    }\n</style>\n<p>(3 2 3) -> 3</p>\n<div id=\"tuxun\"><img id=\"tuxun_img\" src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eb4b6dc866fd421b8275e62e955213d8.png\" style=\"border: 1px solid black\"></div>\n\n<script>\nif (document.getElementById(\"tuxun_img\").complete) {\n    document.getElementById(\"tuxun\").scrollLeft = 22000;\n} else {\n    document.getElementById(\"tuxun_img\").onload = () => {\n        document.getElementById(\"tuxun\").scrollLeft = 22000;\n    };\n} \n</script>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":26,\"imgUrl\":\"95566727de4840f8a2ea1bc045d22286.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"682px\",\"left\":\"1268px\"}","pgid":3,"pg_name":"印刷","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/95566727de4840f8a2ea1bc045d22286.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-081dbb11dfcb498760eb763d","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eb4b6dc866fd421b8275e62e955213d8.png","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eb4b6dc866fd421b8275e62e955213d8.png","mime":"image/png","size":76137,"sha256":"ba2f11e6901a6d13d2309925f916b4085bb77e5fffd0b788fe816218e84af37e","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]},{"id":"asset-38dc1489209effed424d